<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE CUP THIRD ROUND DRAW.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE CUP THIRD ROUND DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for the third round of the English Football League Cup made on Wednesday:</p>
<p>York v Leicester</p>
<p>Tottenham v Sunderland</p>
<p>Port Vale v Oxford</p>
<p>Bolton v Chelsea</p>
<p>Wimbledon v Luton</p>
<p>West Ham v Nottingham Forest</p>
<p>Charlton v Liverpool</p>
<p>Gillingham v Coventry</p>
<p>Ipswich v Crystal Palace</p>
<p>Southampton v Lincoln</p>
<p>Blackburn v Stockport</p>
<p>Manchester United v Swindon</p>
<p>Middlesbrough v Huddersfield</p>
<p>Newcastle v Oldham</p>
<p>Stoke v Arsenal</p>
<p>Leeds v Aston Villa</p>
<p>Ties to be played week beginning October 21.</p>
